    "methodologyNotes": [
      "ExpectedToolCalled is all-or-nothing over the FULL declared expectedTools set since 2026-08-21 (previously only expectedTools[0] was checked). Categories whose skill contract changed (e.g. threat-hunting requiring generate_esql before execute_esql) score lower than in pre-fix matrices for identical traces.",
      "FinalAnswerPresent evaluator added 2026-08-22: scores 0 when a run ends on a tool call with no user-facing final message (observed in 62% of detection-rule-edit runs). Folded into every cell mean.",
      "Repetition depth varies by model: determinism-sweep models ran 3 reps/example, batch models 1 rep. Trace cards carry an N reps badge; 1-rep cells have proportionally higher variance.",
      "Scores are means over 9 evaluators (8 score-typed + FinalAnswerPresent), scaled to 0-10. Token/latency/tool-count observability evaluators are excluded from cell means.",
      "Fixture fingerprint pins the dataset/tool seeds this matrix was scored against; comparing across fingerprints is a cross-generation comparison, not a model delta."
    ]
  }
